==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology===
From {{term|Srbija|Sr̀bija|Serbia|lang=sh}}.

===Proper noun===
{{sh-proper-noun|g=m|head=Србија́нац|c|Srbijanac|Srbijánac}}

# a [[Serbian]] (either a citizen of Serbia, or an ethnic Serb from Serbia)

