====Usage notes====
The term {{term|Srbin|Sȑbin|lang=sh}} denotes an ethnic Serb, whilst the term {{term|Srbijanac|Srbijánac|lang=sh}} denotes either a Serb from [[Central Serbia]] (Serbia excluding Vojvodina) or a a citizen of [[Serbia]] regardless of his ethnicity. The word has almost no usage in spoken common speech, and is primarily used in literary language, such as within the phrase {{term||srbijanski preds(j)ednik|the president of Serbia}}. The terms is usually considered derogatory by Serbs, and the terms {{term|Srbin|Sȑbin|lang=sh}} and {{term|Srpkinja|Sȑpkinja|lang=sh}} are to be used instead.

